$("#loginForm").addEventListener("submit", login); $("#logoutButton").addEventListener("click", logout); $("#newProjectButton").addEventListener("click", () => newProjectForm()); $("#emptyNewButton").addEventListener("click", () => newProjectForm()); $("#newProjectForm").addEventListener("submit", createProject); $("#dwgInput").addEventListener("change", uploadDwg); $("#saveButton").addEventListener("click", save); $("#addRowButton").addEventListener("click", addForm); $("#exportButton").addEventListener("click", exportExcel); $("#applyProjectRulesButton").addEventListener("click", applyProjectReplacementRules); boot();

